flowchart TD
    A[Authorized seller: text or consented audio] --> B[Existing membership and input checks]
    B --> C[Provider HTTP response bytes]
    C --> D{Strict raw JSON object: unique keys and finite numbers}
    D -- invalid --> F[Existing AI_UNAVAILABLE and manual fallback]
    D -- valid envelope --> E[Existing status / content / transcription checks]
    E --> G[Inner extraction JSON text]
    G --> H{Strict raw JSON before normalization}
    H -- invalid --> F
    H -- valid --> I[Authoritative input or STT transcript]
    I --> J[Existing Pydantic schema: reject extra fields]
    J --> K[Source amounts / receipt grammar / bounded name forms]
    K --> L[Unknown or contradictory evidence stays uncertain]
    L --> M[Business-scoped candidate lookup and draft]
    M --> N[Seller reviews fields and selects customer / original sale]
    N --> O[Explicit confirmation]
    O --> P[Unchanged idempotent ledger / ownership checks]
    P --> Q[SQL operation and balances]
    J -- invalid --> F
